00:16:58.626 --> 00:17:00.418
Oh, boy, oh, boy,
oh, boy.

00:17:00.753 --> 00:17:02.295
I hope it's me.

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:10.679
Wait a minute. There's a chance I could lose?

00:17:10.763 --> 00:17:12.430
That wasn't
part of the deal.

00:17:14.767 --> 00:17:18.478
Sweet Georgia Brown of Kingston Town. It's a tie.

00:17:18.563 --> 00:17:21.356
Since no one lost,
no one has to jump.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:23.817
All right, a tie!
I win again!

00:17:25.027 --> 00:17:26.778
I'm a scuzzball.

00:17:26.904 --> 00:17:30.073
Don't feel bad.
At least you're not Leela.

00:17:32.994 --> 00:17:34.202
A tie?

00:17:34.287 --> 00:17:36.496
This worked out better
than I could have hoped.

00:17:36.581 --> 00:17:38.874
Now I'll have two
million zombies.

00:17:38.958 --> 00:17:42.752
Actually, Fry and Bender may
share some of the same followers.

00:17:42.837 --> 00:17:44.379
All we can say
for sure is that

00:17:44.463 --> 00:17:47.465
there will be between one
million and two million zombies.

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:49.301
All I can say
for sure is...

00:17:50.219 --> 00:17:53.972
Now, stop getting slapped
and power up the twit-worm!

00:18:06.319 --> 00:18:11.573
It's both disgusting and
inspiring, like Jared from Subway.

00:18:11.657 --> 00:18:14.117
Okay, I'm a freak
with a singing butt boil,

00:18:14.243 --> 00:18:16.703
but I'm still a human being,
more or less.

00:18:16.787 --> 00:18:20.290
Singing butts boil?
That's yesterdays's news.

00:18:20.374 --> 00:18:23.919
Like that giant caterpillar
what ate Jared from Subway.

00:18:24.003 --> 00:18:28.048
Nows us Internet geeks gots
a whole new video sensation.

00:18:28.132 --> 00:18:30.216
So, my humiliation
is over?

00:18:30.301 --> 00:18:31.676
Who are you?

00:18:36.474 --> 00:18:39.559
And now, to create
an unstoppable army

00:18:39.644 --> 00:18:42.395
of between one and two
million zombies!

00:18:44.482 --> 00:18:46.900
Shouldn't you wait for the weather to clear up?

00:18:46.984 --> 00:18:50.862
No. I give you
the twit-worm!

00:18:53.366 --> 00:18:54.532
Send.

00:19:03.626 --> 00:19:05.919
I'm sick of my head
doing things.

00:19:06.003 --> 00:19:07.003
Leela!

00:19:07.088 --> 00:19:09.005
Fry,
I came to talk to you.

00:19:09.090 --> 00:19:11.216
No,
I came to talk to you.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:14.177
It looked like you were just
sitting there, but whatever.

00:19:14.261 --> 00:19:17.138
I am so, so sorry
for what I did,

00:19:17.223 --> 00:19:18.974
and I know I can never
make it up to you.

00:19:19.058 --> 00:19:22.811
You don't have to apologize.
In fact, I came to thank you.

00:19:23.062 --> 00:19:24.646
I think you mean hit me.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:27.649
Everyone knows my secret,
but no one cares.

00:19:27.733 --> 00:19:29.859
I have nothing
to hide anymore.

00:19:30.152 --> 00:19:33.154
Fry, thanks to
your selfish rudeness,

00:19:33.239 --> 00:19:36.449
a terrible weight has been
lifted from my heart.

00:19:36.534 --> 00:19:39.369
That's not the only place you
need a terrible weight lifted.

00:19:40.538 --> 00:19:42.163
Susan and I are agreed.

00:19:42.248 --> 00:19:46.626
For the first time in our lives,
we're not ashamed of who we are.

00:19:46.711 --> 00:19:48.837
I was never ashamed.

00:19:48.921 --> 00:19:50.296
Come here.

00:19:51.632 --> 00:19:54.676
What stinks? Were you
rolling around in New Jersey?

00:19:54.760 --> 00:19:57.345
Leela, I knew I could
never make it up to you,

00:19:57.430 --> 00:19:59.180
so I did the next best thing.

00:19:59.265 --> 00:20:02.684
I put myself through the same
humiliation I put you through.

00:20:21.912 --> 00:20:24.330
Aw. You didn't
have to do that.

00:20:24.457 --> 00:20:26.082
I didn't? Damn.

00:20:26.208 --> 00:20:29.335
Don't worry. By tomorrow,
no one will remember.

00:20:29.587 --> 00:20:31.629
Can I have another hug?
No.

00:20:32.214 --> 00:20:34.632
Hold your nose
and give it a go.

00:20:52.443 --> 00:20:56.905
Introducing
the all-new eyePhone 2.0.

00:21:00.868 --> 00:21:03.036
Dumb bastards.